{"title":"You’re the Only One I Can See","synopsis":"Mengikuti saran dari teman khayalannya, Jason, yang memberitahunya, “Perlakukan semua cewek seperti batu,” Park Jin-yong mulai melihat setiap perempuan sebagai batu. Namun kemudian Sunwoo, seorang siswi yang sama sekali tidak terlihat seperti batu, muncul di hadapannya, dan untuk pertama kalinya dalam lima tahun, pemandangan wajah seorang gadis sukses membuat sirkuit-sirkuit kecil kebahagiaan Jinyong bekerja gila-gilaan…","alternative_title":"너만 보인단 말이야","author":"Chae-Gun","artist":"Dodge (II)","genres":["Comedy","Romance"],"chapters":[{"id":"6281f7c4-1897-4380-a98f-b5a0def5da3a","number":"22","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"id":"abd1af56-d670-4ca3-91a8-5db7c05881be","number":"21","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-08-02","images":[]},{"id":"11422b44-e060-4d77-8edc-d6b8c1494a49","number":"20","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"id":"e3f8ced0-6f14-48c0-8da7-47142cb2bff9","number":"19","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"id":"abcdbaa9-a335-46b4-a34c-8e1404751cbf","number":"18","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"id":"929adf5f-1d1b-4564-9589-45d1ea5d2987","number":"17","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-06-25","images":[]},{"id":"f5b62099-4386-4b04-94fa-20321ddca201","number":"16","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-06-17","images":[]},{"id":"e345d3ee-42df-4a72-a61f-ae38dc00445c","number":"15","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-06-11","images":[]},{"id":"50979c33-d26c-4e2e-9aa0-5828cb86a448","number":"14","title":"Chapter 14","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"a430ac79-9aac-4f6c-bdea-3c59666cfeaf","number":"13","title":"Chapter 13","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"e1fc2463-2e46-4cf9-bc64-b291bb3bef1d","number":"12","title":"Chapter 12","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"51417d4b-44b1-4412-a5bb-d486d4472514","number":"11","title":"Chapter 11","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"b1579848-7ed1-4ce7-b4c7-5c0001437fb4","nu